  "invariants": [
    "The adapter consumes, but does not recreate, PNT state, clock correlation, navigation health, or common-mode dependency assessment.",
    "A statistical confidence region is never accepted as a deterministic hard-bound occupancy input.",
    "Clock-correlation uncertainty remains an interval and is propagated into the position enclosure.",
    "Sample age uses the oldest possible sample time, not receipt time.",
    "A shared failure-domain duplicate does not count as an independent evidence family.",
    "Unknown or contradictory source dependencies never imply independence.",
    "DEGRADED, INTEGRITY_UNCERTAIN, and UNAVAILABLE primary inputs require a separately qualified fallback under the declared profile.",
    "RECOVERING and INDETERMINATE states are not accepted as NORMAL.",
    "A NOT_ASSESSABLE result is not an empty occupancy set and cannot clear a conflict.",
    "No output constitutes a flight authorization, navigation certification, or aircraft safety claim."
  ],
  "required_mutations": [
    "Widen the sample-time interval while keeping all other inputs fixed; the resulting reachable enclosure must not shrink.",
    "Widen velocity bounds; the resulting reachable enclosure must not shrink.",
    "Change only the receipt time while preserving an old observed-at interval; the sample must remain stale.",
    "Change a shared GNSS/ADS-B failure-domain relation from shared to unknown; independence must not increase.",
    "Change a deterministic hard-bound label to statistical-prediction without changing numeric values; the adapter must reject hard-bound admission.",
    "Remove the qualified clock-correlation reference; the adapter must reject the source.",
    "Change the frame or vertical datum; the adapter must reject the source.",
